# fixtures/hex/store-a/seg.d7.hex: store A's second delta ([F09 §16.2]) over [11264, 16660):
# the touched rows #5 (file mv, foreign import), #7 (native import) and #16 (the tombstone an import-checkpoint
# brought in), ± lists against seg.d1, and the store-level tables as of 16660. The five derived-optional
# runtime caches are absent here ([F09 §3.3]: a reader treats them as empty). The first segment with full-text
# tier 2 (tok_ver 1, [F17 §6.4]): TERMS and POST over the touched rows' documents (#7 only: #5 has no text,
# #16 is deleted), DOCLEN per touched row and FTSSTAT for the whole view (candidate `kept` of HOLE(F09-doclen)).

